<div>

<div>
CaHPO<span class="subsm">4</span>
<img border="0" src="../images/chars/blank.gif" width="5" height="2"><img border="0" src="../images/chars/blank.gif" width="5" height="2"><img border="0" src="../images/chars/blank.gif" width="5" height="2"><img border="0" src="../images/chars/blank.gif" width="5" height="2"><img border="0" src="../images/chars/blank.gif" width="5" height="2">136.06</div>

<div>

